---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer
  class="border-t border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-bold">
          <span
            class="grid h-6 w-6 place-items-center rounded bg-brand-600 text-white"
          >
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              class="h-3.5 w-3.5 fill-current"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path
                d="M5 3a1 1 0 011-1h8a1 1 0 011 1v14a1 1 0 01-1.6.8L10 14.5l-3.4 3.3A1 1 0 015 17V3z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          FlowAgent
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <span class="font-medium text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
            회사 데이터는 노트북 안에만.
          </span>
          <br />
          한국어 사무 자동화, 5종 워크플로 바로 시작.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-500">
          로컬 실행 · 가입 불필요 · 평생 무료로 시작
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
          제품
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a
              href="/download"
              class="text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
              >다운로드</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/pricing"
              class="text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
              >가격</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/templates"
              class="text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
              >템플릿</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/docs"
              class="text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
              >문서</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
          회사
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a
              href="/blog"
              class="text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
              >블로그</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/security"
              class="text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
              >보안 정책</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/wndnjs3865/flowagent"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
              rel="noopener"
            >
              GitHub
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 16 16"
                class="h-3 w-3 fill-current"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path
                  d="M6 1.75A.75.75 0 016.75 1H14a.75.75 0 01.75.75v7.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0V3.56l-7.72 7.72a.75.75 0 11-1.06-1.06L12.19 2.5H6.75A.75.75 0 016 1.75z"
                ></path>
                <path
                  d="M2 4.75A.75.75 0 012.75 4H7v1.5H3.5v8h8V10H13v4.25a.75.75 0 01-.75.75h-9.5a.75.75 0 01-.75-.75v-9.5z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="mailto:wndnjs3865@naver.com"
              class="text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
              >문의</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-6 text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:border-zinc-800 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"
    >
      <div>© {year} FlowAgent · 사업자등록번호 607-20-94796</div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a
          href="/terms"
          class="hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-100">이용약관</a
        >
        <a
          href="/privacy"
          class="hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-100"
          >개인정보처리방침</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
